			"widgets_values":[
				"integrated_multimodal_description:\n\n[Shot 1]\n\nLive-action, cinematic premium technology-commercial style, presented in a 16:9 widescreen composition.\n\nThe segment begins from the previous segment's exact ending state at the outdoor staircase.\n\nThe same young adult female runner has her right foot planted on the first stair, her left leg extended behind, her body leaning forward, and the active GPS route visible on her raised left wrist.\n\nShe retains the same black ponytail, cobalt-blue running jacket, black leggings, and black running shoes.\n\nThe NOVA X1 retains its matte-black titanium rounded-square case, edge-to-edge sapphire display, black sport strap, and cyan-ringed digital crown.\n\nShe sprints upward while the camera tracks beside her at fast speed.\n\nNo other people, reflections, silhouettes, or human figures appear anywhere.\n\n\n[Shot 2]\n\nAt 00:02.300, the camera arcs around her as she reaches the upper platform overlooking the sunrise city.\n\nShe slows to a stop, steadies her breathing, and raises her left wrist toward the golden light.\n\nThe display transitions from the GPS route to a clean summary showing \"WORKOUT COMPLETE\" and \"2.6 KM\".\n\nThe camera rapidly pushes into the watch, keeping its case, crown, strap, and screen sharply detailed.\n\n\n[Shot 3]\n\nAt 00:04.000, the camera settles into a product-focused composition.\n\nThe NOVA X1 fills the foreground on the runner's raised wrist.\n\nThe runner remains as the only softly focused person behind the product, facing the sunrise.\n\nThe visible product name \"NOVA X1\" appears beside the watch.\n\nThe visible tagline \"MOVE SMARTER\" appears beneath it.\n\nThe composition remains static and fully readable until 00:05.000.\n\n\noverall_soundscape:\n\nRunning steps continue naturally from the previous segment, followed by faster stair impacts, fabric movement, controlled breathing, rooftop wind, and one clean workout-completion tone.\n\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n\nThe rising bass pattern and electronic percussion continue seamlessly from the previous segment.\n\nThey resolve into a strong bass hit, sustained synthesizer chord, and one metallic chime as \"NOVA X1\" and \"MOVE SMARTER\" appear.",
				480,
				864,
				73
			],
